msgid "Reviewed shallow tickless timebase"
msgstr "已审浅睡眠 tickless timebase"

msgid ""
"`[os].lowpower_port = \"timebase\"` selects a maintained private FreeRTOS "
"binding for STM32F407 and GD32F470. The default is `\"custom\"`: existing "
"application-provided ports and the weak NULL fallback keep their behavior. "
"Selection also requires `tickless = true`, SysTick, a single privileged "
"security domain and no MPU profile. CPU-only Runtime configurations reject "
"this selection because they have no reviewed SoC timer, clock or IRQ facts."
msgstr ""
"`[os].lowpower_port = \"timebase\"` 选择维护中的 STM32F407／GD32F470 私有 FreeRTOS "
"绑定。默认 `\"custom\"` 保持既有应用 port 与弱 NULL 回退行为。选择还要求 `tickless = "
"true`、SysTick、单一特权安全域且无 MPU profile。纯 CPU Runtime 因缺少已审 SoC timer／clock／IRQ "
"事实而拒绝此选择。"

msgid ""
"This binding uses shallow Sleep. The fixed clock and 1 MHz monotonic timer "
"keep running. It does not enter STOP, suspend clocks, select a different "
"tick source, configure a wake pin or make board electrical claims."
msgstr ""
"此绑定使用浅 Sleep，固定时钟与 1 MHz 单调 timer 持续运行。不进入 STOP、不暂停时钟、不选其他 tick "
"源、不配置唤醒引脚，也不声明板级电气事实。"

