msgid ""
"The timer is already exclusively reserved by the platform timebase. No "
"output channel is connected to a pin. The getter only inspects the "
"established profile: the actual PLL tuple, oscillator/source ready bits, "
"mux/bus dividers, Flash latency and disabled spread spectrum; the free-"
"running upward timer mode, prescaler, full counter range, disabled compare "
"preload/output, sleep clock, overflow interrupt and enabled NVIC route. "
"Missing facts return NULL; there is no repair or hidden initialization. "
"Clock consumers must remain quiescent throughout platform shutdown. A "
"pending pause or alarm additionally rejects clock release before any "
"register or NVIC effect."
msgstr ""
"Timer 已由平台 timebase 独占预留，没有输出 channel 接到引脚。Getter 仅检查既定配置：真实 PLL "
"tuple、oscillator/source ready、mux/bus 分频、Flash latency 和 spread spectrum "
"关闭，以及自由向上计数、prescaler、完整 counter 范围、compare preload/output 关闭、sleep "
"clock、overflow interrupt 和已使能 NVIC 路由。缺失事实返回 NULL，不修复或隐藏初始化。整个平台停机中 clock "
"consumer 必须保持静止。存在 pause 或 alarm 时，还会在任何寄存器／NVIC 效果前拒绝时钟释放。"

msgid "Phase, admission and failure"
msgstr "Phase、准入与失败"

msgid ""
"The generic Idle adapter owns scheduler suspension and incoming PRIMASK "
"restoration. The private timer callbacks never block or call the kernel. "
"Alarm IRQ dispatch runs under the SoC's saved interrupt guard. SysTick calls"
" the renamed real kernel tick handler once per real periodic interrupt."
msgstr ""
"通用 Idle 适配持有 scheduler suspend 与进入 PRIMASK 恢复。私有 timer 回调绝不阻塞或调用内核。Alarm IRQ"
" dispatch 在 SoC 保存掩码 guard 下运行。SysTick 每次真实周期中断只调用一次重命名后的真实内核 tick handler。"

msgid ""
"Pause rejects a pending periodic tick and a still-active first short "
"interval. The writable snapshot must be disjoint from private retained "
"state, immutable bindings, MMIO and opaque clock-context storage. Known "
"spans, alignment and address wrap are checked before effects; the private "
"caller proves the opaque clock-context extent. A successful pause retains "
"the periodic-source loan until resume. The paused counter records whole "
"microseconds and the remaining core-cycle fraction. Each capture and restore"
" rejects a clock reversal or an observed sampling window larger than four "
"continuous-clock microseconds."
msgstr ""
"Pause 拒绝 pending 周期 tick 与仍活动的首个短间隔。可写快照须与私有保留状态、不可变绑定、MMIO 和不透明 clock-"
"context 存储分离。已知范围、对齐和地址回绕在效果前检查；私有调用方证明不透明 clock-context 大小。成功 pause "
"保留周期源借用直到 resume。暂停计数记录完整微秒及剩余 core-cycle fraction。每次 capture／restore "
"均拒绝时钟逆跳或超过四个连续时钟微秒的观察窗口。"

msgid ""
"An alarm uses an absolute deadline in that same boot domain. Admission "
"requires strictly future time, at most `UINT32_MAX` microseconds ahead. The "
"low 32 bits match the free-running counter across one wrap. Late arm, "
"compare readback failure or disabled-source readback failure never become "
"successful admission. Rejected alarms remove only their own interrupt "
"source. Timer status is W0C: ones preserve all unrelated sources, including "
"a compare event arriving between an overflow flag read and acknowledgement."
msgstr ""
"Alarm 使用同一启动域的绝对 deadline；准入要求严格未来时间，距当前最多 `UINT32_MAX` 微秒。低 32 "
"位在一次回绕范围内匹配自由计数器。迟到 arm、compare 读回失败或 disabled-source 读回失败都不能报告准入成功。拒绝 alarm"
" 只移除自身中断源。Timer status 是 W0C：写一保留全部其他源，包括 overflow 读与确认之间到达的 compare。"

msgid ""
"Resume programs one short SysTick interval. It proves that VAL consumed the "
"short reload, then restores the full LOAD before the first underflow. "
"Restoring LOAD only in the first ISR would allow a second short interval. "
"The wrapper also restores the full LOAD before kernel dispatch. A sub-"
"microsecond remainder is rounded up by less than one microsecond, rather "
"than relying on an unprovable near-zero reload race."
msgstr ""
"Resume 编程一个短 SysTick 间隔，证明 VAL 已消费短 reload 后，在首次 underflow 前恢复完整 LOAD。若只在首 "
"ISR 恢复 LOAD，就可能发生第二个短间隔。包装也在内核 dispatch 前恢复完整 "
"LOAD。亚微秒余数向上取整，误差小于一微秒，而不是依赖无法证明的近零 reload 竞态。"

msgid ""
"The precision contract is quantized. A 1 MHz clock cannot represent "
"arbitrary core-cycle timestamps, and register operations have latency. The "
"model executes 15 phase/latency combinations with a continuously advancing "
"timer and proves those executions fall in a conservative minus-one to plus-"
"eleven microsecond phase interval. The independent capture and restore "
"window checks are the runtime bound; the model is not a proof of physical "
"MCU instruction latency or all hardware executions. Repeated sleeps can "
"accumulate bounded phase bias. Applications needing tighter synchronization "
"must qualify a separate timer compare clock profile rather than assuming "
"exact sub-microsecond phase."
msgstr ""
"精度合同是量化的。1 MHz 时钟不能表示任意 core-cycle 时间戳，寄存器操作有延迟。模型在持续推进 timer 下执行 15 种 "
"phase/latency 组合，证明这些执行位于保守的负一到正十一微秒 phase 区间。独立 capture／restore "
"窗口检查是运行时边界；模型不证明物理 MCU 指令延迟或全部硬件执行。重复睡眠可能累积有界 phase 偏差。更紧同步需求必须另行验证 timer "
"compare 时钟配置，不能假定精确亚微秒 phase。"

msgid ""
"A pending tick, COUNTFLAG, late first underflow, unconsumed reload or "
"incorrect restored control bits makes resume fail stop. Failed pause "
"rollback also fails stop if the source cannot be restored. Failed alarm "
"disable retains both pause and alarm ownership. Fault state never returns a "
"borrowed source to the caller, continues the kernel with missing ticks or "
"attempts automatic reclamation."
msgstr ""
"Pending tick、COUNTFLAG、迟到首次 underflow、reload 未消费或恢复控制位错误会让 resume fail-"
"stop。Pause 回滚失败且无法恢复源时也 fail-stop。Alarm disable 失败同时保留 pause 与 alarm "
"所有权。Fault 状态不归还借用源、不让缺失 tick 的内核继续，也不自动回收。"

msgid "Cost and validation scope"
msgstr "成本与验证范围"

msgid ""
"Selection adds one static private context. For the maintained 32-bit ABI its"
" layout is 16 bytes; the read-only register binding and port face are 52 and"
" 24 bytes. These are structure layouts, not a linked image cost claim. The "
"existing timebase, default request/stream state and OS objects gain no "
"fields. Default source selection omits the common mechanism, SoC binding and"
" selected IRQ branches. Four actual production CMake ARM graphs verify zero "
"default new mechanism TUs/symbols, versus two selected TUs and a strong "
"getter. In the same empty assembly retaining kernel startup, no-LTO "
"Os/GNUArm14.3.1, selection adds 1532 bytes of Flash / 16 bytes RAM on STM32 "
"and 1516 bytes Flash / 16 bytes RAM on GD32. These are development fixture "
"deltas, not application or hardware costs."
msgstr ""
"选择增加一个静态私有 context。维护的 32 位 ABI 中 layout 为 16 字节，只读寄存器绑定和 port 接口面为 52 与 24 "
"字节；这些是结构布局，不是链接镜像成本。既有 timebase、默认 request/stream 状态与 OS "
"对象不增加字段。默认源码选择省略公共机制、SoC 绑定及所选 IRQ 分支。四个真实生产 CMake ARM 图验证默认无新机制 "
"TU／symbol，而选择后有两个 TU 与 strong getter。在保留 kernel startup 的同一 empty "
"assembly、no-LTO Os/GNUArm14.3.1 下，STM32 增加 Flash 1532／RAM 16 字节，GD32 增加 "
"Flash 1516／RAM 16 字节。这些是开发夹具差值，不是应用或硬件成本。"

msgid ""
"The GoogleTest / GoogleMock suites execute production common C, actual SDK "
"register layouts, real SoC timebase IRQ and shutdown code. Tests cover "
"pending arrival, reversed time, late compare, counter wrap, failed "
"disable/restore, first-reload consumption, second-pause rejection and shared"
" IRQ flag races. The two chip suites use external CPU, clock-bootstrap and "
"register semantics models; they are software evidence."
msgstr ""
"GoogleTest／GoogleMock 执行生产公共 C、真实 SDK 寄存器布局、真实 SoC timebase IRQ 与停机代码，覆盖 "
"pending 到达、时钟逆跳、迟到 compare、counter wrap、disable/restore 失败、首 reload 消费、第二 "
"pause 拒绝及共享 IRQ 标志竞态。两芯片 suite 使用外部 CPU、clock-bootstrap 和寄存器语义模型，属于软件证据。"

msgid ""
"Physical HIL has not run. Acceptance still requires the real boards and "
"probes: verify shallow-Sleep clock continuity, NVIC wake, actual "
"capture/restore windows, SysTick phase and catch-up across repeated sleeps, "
"wrap, competing interrupts and load. Neither model timing nor ARM linking "
"establishes power savings, physical WCET, IRQ latency or board readiness."
msgstr ""
"物理 HIL 未执行。验收仍需真实板与探针：浅 Sleep 时钟连续、NVIC 唤醒、真实 capture/restore 窗口、反复睡眠的 "
"SysTick phase/catch-up、回绕、竞争中断和负载。模型时序或 ARM 链接不能建立功耗收益、物理 WCET、IRQ 延迟或板卡就绪。"
